ATTRIBUTION

This project is an independent implementation of the ideas described in
"The AI-Native SDLC Playbook", published by Anthropic:

    https://claude.com/blog/the-ai-native-sdlc-playbook

The stage model, the artifact chain (intent.md, spec.md, plan.md), the
distinction between advisory and deterministic controls, the tiered control-band
response, and several illustrative file formats are drawn from that article.
Some short configuration examples closely follow the ones published there.

