EXEMPLAR CONTENT

Some files ship deliberately as worked examples carrying placeholder rules --
notably kit/claude/skills/secure-api-review/SKILL.md and kit/evals/cases/. They
demonstrate a shape and must be replaced with your own policy before you rely on
them. Each such file says so at the top.

The organisations, people, systems and incidents in examples/ are fictional.
